%description:
Tests TcpSocket::setKeepAlive() before the open. The server application turns
keepalive on at t=0.2, before its listen at t=0.5, and the connection of t=1
takes it. After the idle time of 30 s, the server sends a probe with
SEG.SEQ = SND.UNA - 1 = 250500, and the client answers it.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 40s
*.srv_app.tOpen=0.5s
*.srv_app.keepAliveScript="0.2 1"
*.cli_app.tOpen=1s
*.srv_tcp.keepAliveIdleTime = 30s
*.srv_tcp.keepAliveInterval = 5s

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 250500:250500(0) ack 250001 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[1.005 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 250501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[31.007 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 250001 win 16384 
[31.009 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 250501 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Sending keepalive probe, seq=250500
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
